# YouTube Content Intelligence

Lux can combine YouTube Data API records, YouTube Analytics API reports, trend
samples, and historical channel samples into content optimization reports.

The integration covers:

- analytics data collection and processing
- audience engagement analysis
- explainable performance prediction
- posting-time prediction
- title, thumbnail, tag, and description generation
- trend matching
- recommendations for thumbnail, script, engagement, and tags

## API Collection

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.YouTube.Client

Client.videos(["video-id"], api_key: System.fetch_env!("YOUTUBE_API_KEY"))

Client.analytics_report(
  access_token: "oauth-token",
  start_date: "2026-01-01",
  end_date: "2026-01-31",
  metrics: ["views", "likes", "comments", "shares", "averageViewDuration"]
)
```

## Content Report

```elixir
alias Lux.Integrations.YouTube.ContentIntelligence

video = %{
  id: "video-1",
  title: "Elixir AI agents for YouTube growth",
  views: 10_000,
  likes: 300,
  comments: 80,
  shares: 40,
  impressions: 50_000,
  clicks: 3_000,
  duration_seconds: 600,
  average_view_duration_seconds: 270,
  tags: ["Elixir", "AI agents"]
}

ContentIntelligence.content_report(video, %{
  trends: [%{term: "AI agents", score: 40}],
  historical_samples: [%{views: 4_000}, %{views: 7_000}],
  posting_samples: [%{weekday: "Tuesday", hour: 9, engagements: 100}]
})
```

The report returns engagement metrics, prediction bands, title/thumbnail/tag
metadata suggestions, prioritized recommendations, and ranked posting windows.
